# Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) — DonateNow

> Phase: 03 — Success Metrics
> Previous: [PRD.mdc](./PRD.mdc)
> Next: [Personas](./persona/)

---

## 1. Core Success Metrics (MVP Gates)

These KPIs must pass before the MVP can be considered "done".

| # | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **KPI-001** | Payment Flow Success | End-to-end test of Razorpay payment via iOS SDK in test mode. | Manual + XCUITest | 100% success rate | Pending |
| **KPI-002** | Thank-You View Display | User is navigated to the Thank You view immediately after successful payment. | Manual + XCUITest | Navigates on success | Pending |
| **KPI-003** | Admin Donor Log View | Admin can log in via the app and view the list of successful donations. | Manual + XCUITest | Data loads successfully | Pending |

---

## 2. Functional Metrics

| # | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **KPI-004** | Cause Loading | The cause title, description, and target load correctly from Supabase. | XCTest | Matches DB record | Pending |
| **KPI-005** | Predefined Amounts | Selecting ₹100/₹500/₹1000 populates the form correctly. | XCUITest | UI updates correctly | Pending |
| **KPI-006** | Custom Amount | User can enter a custom amount between ₹1 and ₹1,00,000. | XCUITest | Accepts valid, rejects invalid | Pending |
| **KPI-007** | Server-Side Signature | Supabase Edge Function verifies the Razorpay payment signature correctly. | Integration Test | Valid passes, invalid fails | Pending |
| **KPI-008** | Webhook Processing | Razorpay webhook correctly updates the donation status in Supabase. | Integration Test | Status changes to 'completed' | Pending |
| **KPI-009** | Admin Auth Persistence | Admin remains logged in across app restarts until explicit logout. | Manual Testing | Session restored | Pending |
| **KPI-010** | Donor Search | Admin can search the donor log by name or email. | XCUITest | Filters correctly | Pending |
| **KPI-011** | Date Filtering | Admin can filter the donor log by a specific date range. | XCUITest | Filters correctly | Pending |
| **KPI-012** | Stats Aggregation | Dashboard total amount and count match the database exactly. | Unit Test (SQL function) | 100% match | Pending |

