## 3. Performance Metrics

| # | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **KPI-013** | App Launch Time | Time from app launch to donation screen fully rendered. | Xcode Instruments (Time Profiler) | < 2.0 seconds | Pending |
| **KPI-014** | API Response Time | Edge Function response time for create-order and verify-payment. | Network Monitor | < 500ms (P90) | Pending |
| **KPI-015** | Admin Dashboard Load | Time to fetch and render admin stats and recent donations. | Xcode Instruments | < 1.5 seconds | Pending |
| **KPI-016** | Donor Log Scrolling | Smooth scrolling performance on the donor log list. | Xcode Instruments (Animation) | 60 FPS | Pending |
| **KPI-017** | Memory Footprint | Max memory usage during standard donation flow. | Xcode Instruments (Allocations) | < 150 MB | Pending |

---

## 4. Security Metrics (Strict Gates)

| # | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **KPI-018** | Zero PCI Data Stored | Ensure no credit card or UPI data is stored in the database or app state. | Code Review + DB Audit | 0 instances | Pending |
| **KPI-019** | RLS Enabled | Supabase Row Level Security blocks public reads on `donations` and `admin_users`. | API Test (Anonymous) | 401 Unauthorized / Empty Array | Pending |
| **KPI-020** | Webhook Security | Webhook handler verifies `X-Razorpay-Signature` header. | Integration Test | Rejects missing/invalid | Pending |
| **KPI-021** | Admin View Protection | Admin views cannot be accessed without a valid Supabase Auth session. | XCUITest | Redirects to login | Pending |
| **KPI-022** | Secret Storage | No API secrets (Supabase service role, Razorpay key_secret) in iOS source code. | Static Analysis | 0 secrets in iOS code | Pending |

