| # | KPI Name | Description | Verification Method | Target | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **KPI-023** | Universal Layout | UI adapts correctly to both iPhone and iPad screen sizes. | Simulator (iPhone SE to iPad Pro) | No clipping, correct padding | Pending |
| **KPI-024** | Form Validation Feedback | Invalid inputs show clear inline error messages immediately. | XCUITest | Error text visible | Pending |
