## Acceptance Gates

| Gate | Required KPIs | Who Approves |
|---|---|---|
| **Security Review** | KPI-018, KPI-019, KPI-020, KPI-021, KPI-022 | Developer / Security Persona |
| **QA / Testing** | KPI-004 through KPI-012, KPI-023 through KPI-025 | Developer / Test Persona |
| **Performance** | KPI-013 through KPI-017 | Developer |
| **MVP Launch** | KPI-001, KPI-002, KPI-003 | Project Sponsor |

---

## Verification Schedule

- **Unit Tests (XCTest)**: Run on every commit.
- **Integration Tests (Edge Functions)**: Run manually before major PRs.
- **UI Tests (XCUITest)**: Run manually before final delivery.
- **Performance/Memory Profiling**: Run once before MVP launch.
- **Security Audit**: Code review before MVP launch.
